      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜者舞台是梦想的舞台。\n每个人都渴望站上C位，\n来为支持自己的粉丝献上感谢的歌曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b7bd1674eb6dfbf56ac08c923ebf1236ab6d98656eb49f63b9d6f7ac7852a12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
