      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，醒目飞鹰正在为演唱会做练习。\n可是，其他赛马娘对于伴舞的练习都提不起劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0448bbf43576e383c7aea7893d7b9837f16ab1395f5c6929debb4b4bf15bdddc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
