    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed039f51a142fb1f2c192197",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰认为无论是何种形式，\n都要为了传达感谢给粉丝而好好努力。\n然而，她的诉求并没有得到认同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d64145361249114cd576bc72e42cd0a32a024108a5322ff3abbc8a1eeb56db2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76fa3260addd0d97898d506",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰为此感到烦恼。\nC位是大家的梦想。全力竞争后所生的\n光辉固然可贵，但同时也会产生摩擦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32fdf5343f20a03ae7586bf7def78d8d0c964e469b524927f65e325cccea48ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2df0964d1663f094c75d0e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她开始想，没有C位和\n伴舞的区别会不会比较好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2766a4585b707f762755bb28914a614fd20f744202daaa33d1135be07c47c030",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f21ce04ea96c92d8db9dd31",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘轻柔致意就在这时现身。\n自称是制作人的她，提出另一种形式的演唱会，\n也就是“Grand Live”的复办计划！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2cc7f636cbac4860a354235f84f5eee8739c76134f2e0e97acec219bbb3e039",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93bf2b0a7f09197b004aa15e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在光辉照耀不到的地方",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca1eb5f3c638bdf8348742df53f961ef3539ee7e8d33de1b475529a3ee0bb389",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f44906b67c7ee749eefce377",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据说，过去每年都会有一场由学生自发举办，\n所有赛马娘都能参加演出的活动──\n“Grand Live”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5ed7f235f24528fdf8bf80bc958a46a5aa6554dc62d33073e5f4f8689544988",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bef9daa983dfd840dc7f237f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，那终究是过去的事物。\n虽然轻柔致意提出复办的主张，\n但URA不断以没有人期待为由拒绝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a329a081938ceb2b5ce770e6759098d3a5ab48a8cb8b20412fbd7b15f84bfd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2230a0916c32ed5422ebcb2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她希望提供大家能够传达感谢的演唱会舞台。\n这份心意让醒目飞鹰产生共鸣，而愿意协助她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91bd4b00febede54203d85170fe07b206528a9d5e8db6665083590ff28d2dff9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fda55a6b759dc5bf5a966840",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了使Grand Live复活，\n让宣传演唱会成功来增加赞同者吧！\nGrand Live复办计划，开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "986dc54c6248e344512bf707c72a38fd13cecca980d0f5c0e4ba5dba93a4e9d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6f2b6452e019c5a0159b4a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Grand Live复办计划，启动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f8990ff09b38fbd44e93a7944aa8d7223f265c125b1a09faee673dbbc8d1d91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d9e1bf0e869101cce3f447",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65ed35baada1909bb37e62d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我向美浦波旁说明，\n为了复办Grand Live，而要举办宣传演唱会，\n并进行相关训练的计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3def4510d20c18776310481548d6a7506e10896af89071b3c2c24bc6477c9e1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f540fe7a1ced7bf3ab52c3d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5029400bff573e9a86982f48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然告诉了美浦波旁这不是命令，\n而是希望她能以自己的意愿参加，\n但本人似乎还不是很明白的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "071400e8d97baf0e5c9b322c61cff72927259c791d72d2c10a355d0760ec039f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90eafae2d164ca2f102201f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acfa6a2320d072acbe820b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果有一天，\n美浦波旁主动表示想要参加的话，\n就让她登上舞台吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a59d4e07ce7d86b57ae85e679b7f7847c4b38701246fc9a84607db6b14cd0e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25868dcf5e50381b74cf908a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说明≠命令",
      "source_fingerprint": "567cac43fb0e213f7b559d6b408e52f7046ebc6db68a349d510da1266ec0ad39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c6130b60508da227b0fbd6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们日日勤奋地为宣传演唱会而忙碌着。\n轻柔致意负责处理杂务和事前准备，\n并且积极地协助我们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0faa085d4ccb30b9ad59e3993bd6773bff6782721a3b9d94f060975982e4c8b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40705dc63a2a3e43aa5421b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，没有人停下来看我们的突击演唱会。\n轻柔致意认为是她的能力不足，而感到沮丧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "155f33ca33d94add5c4ab8ad687f44803adb92deae4eaf2c628221badfbaed27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4a3f6d90fcc313b15dc89eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管醒目飞鹰鼓起干劲，\n表示下次要抓住观众的心，\n轻柔致意似乎还是有点没精神──",
      "source_fingerprint": "009690e45afcfc0bd9f89de3c7030cc17175bf24804c0416ad36be3738411c2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cbd0ac5fc507dc24dd1fbf0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我约她到咖啡厅谈话。\n在那里，她吐露自己演唱会经验很少，\n所以不知道要怎么做才会成功。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76b4b911655120c3dd460f7d93614033266a441dc8d56aa091f830b854287565",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
